# Cortisstyle — agent orientation

**Live product:** Turkey-first boutique storefronts + Cadde marketplace, two product verticals (fashion, custom_art).
**Archived elsewhere:** international lookbook / wardrobe / Lookbook Studio → sibling `cortisstyle-international`.

Before non-trivial work, read `docs/agent-handoffs/README.md`, then only the one subsystem doc that matches your task.

| Task area | Handoff |
|-----------|---------|
| Tenant model, domains, onboarding a new boutique | `03-multi-tenant-boutiques.md` |
| Custom-domain sitemap/robots (all tenants) | `03` + `.cursor/rules/boutique-custom-domain.mdc` · `src/lib/tr/customDomain.ts` |
| `/tr/[slug]` storefront, editorial home, category browsing, PDP | `04-storefront-editorial-home.md` |
| `/tr/panel`, checkout, orders, shipping, payments | `05-owner-panel-commerce.md` |
| Fashion vertical (garments, sizes, categories) + core/module boundary | `06-fashion-module.md` |
| Custom-art vertical (print-on-demand) + capability-flag pattern | `07-custom-art-module.md` |
| AI catalog pipeline (listing drafts, packshots, try-on) | `08-ai-catalog-pipeline.md` |
| Takım (two-piece set upload) | `08` + `src/lib/tr/fashion/takimUpload.ts` · `/tr/panel/urun/takim` |
| `/tr` Cadde marketplace, looks, platform cart | `09-cadde-marketplace.md` |
| Boutique UI / visual direction | `10-boutique-design-inspiration.md` |
| Env, Supabase, auth, edge proxy, the fashion/core lint boundary | `11-platform-ops.md` |
| International lookbook (archived) | `01-international-lookbook.md` → `cortisstyle-international` |
| Lookbook Studio (archived) | `02-lookbook-studio.md` → archive; **rmbg stays** at `src/lib/tr/ai/photoroomRemoveBg.ts` |
