| Boutique legal templates (yasal) | `docs/tr-boutique-legal-templates.md` |

**Structural changes:** update the matching handoff in the same change — see `.cursor/rules/document-structural-changes.mdc`. Do not leave architecture only in chat, and do not let a doc drift from the code it describes.

Quick anchors: TR URLs `src/lib/tr/paths.ts` · types `src/types/tr-marketplace.ts` · edge proxy `src/proxy.ts` (not `middleware.ts` — this fork renamed it) · custom-domain origin SEO (sitemap/robots passthrough, all boutiques) `src/lib/tr/customDomain.ts` · principles `.cursor/rules/implementation-principles.mdc`.

